title: New lines on one side while the other joins the line right after them and deletes elsewhere: both end with the same text
folders: share-text
limit: 75
expect-log: saved .*notes\.txt
expect-file: share-text\notes.txt :: ^line 01\ne\nline 03line 04\nlin\nline 06\nline 07\nline 08\nHn1\.\nHn2\.\nHn3\.\nHn4\.\nHn5\.\nHn6\.line 09\nline 10\nline 11\nline 12\n$

wait 3000
share start writers
wait 9000
edit notes.txt 8 1
key end
wait 1200
key enter
type Hn1.
wait 250
key enter
type Hn2.
wait 250
key enter
type Hn3.
wait 250
key enter
type Hn4.
wait 250
key enter
type Hn5.
wait 250
key enter
type Hn6.
wait 1200
edit notes.txt 2 1
key end
key backspace
wait 200
key backspace
wait 200
key backspace
wait 3000
mark host-after
wait 9000
quit
wait 800
answer Close without saving
wait 1000
=== guest
wait 2500
share join {INVITE} Beto
wait 4500
edit notes.txt 9 1
wait 3200
key backspace
wait 300
edit notes.txt 5 1
key end
key backspace
wait 150
key backspace
wait 150
key backspace
wait 150
key backspace
wait 300
edit notes.txt 4 1
key backspace
wait 600
edit notes.txt 2 1
key delete
wait 200
key delete
wait 200
key delete
wait 3500
mark after
wait 2500
key save
wait 3000
quit
wait 1500
